    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26338" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαψαίρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>brush away, blow away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμιαμάτων αὖραι διαψαίρουσι πλεκτάνην
					καπνοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1717
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαψαίρουσα πέπλους</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔρα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				6
			</span></i>; <i>cleanse,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλώσσῃ διαψαίρουσα μυκτήρων πόρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					926
				</span></i>
			; <i>scratch through,</i> of birds, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				2.115
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>flutter</i> in the wind, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				127
			</span></i>.</div>
